# This test requires PL/pgSQL PERFORM and nested BEGIN...EXCEPTION support
# which db9 does not implement yet.  The \! background psql coordination
# also causes hangs when the DO blocks fail, making the test unreliable.
#
# Required pattern: proves db9 attempted and rejected the PL/pgSQL syntax.
Expected end of statement, found: PERFORM

